I walk to a small bakery near my flat.
This is a nice shop.
There are many sweets in the shop.
There is a sweet in orange color there.
It is the famous Kozhikodan halwa.
I ask the shopkeeper, "What is the price of this halwa?"
He says, "One box is sixty rupees."
I give sixty rupees.
He gives me one box of halwa.
This halwa is to show my family.
It is very beautiful.
Who in my house likes sweets the most?
My younger sister Sofia likes sweets very much.
She also likes this color very much.
I return to my room with the halwa box.
